This product includes software developed by third parties:

* The integer transform matrices in crates/girc-core/src/transform_tables.rs
  are generated from Fraunhofer HHI's VVenC, which is distributed under the
  BSD 3-Clause Licence. The generator is tools/extract_transform_tables.sh
  and the provenance is recorded in the file's header.

* The transform oracle in tools/transform_oracle.c links Fraunhofer HHI's
  VVenC to produce reference vectors. VVenC is distributed under the BSD
  3-Clause Licence.

* The evaluation portal depends on FastAPI, Starlette, SQLAlchemy,
  Jinja2, argon2-cffi and itsdangerous, each under its own permissive
  licence.

* The benchmark harness invokes x265, SVT-AV1 and VVenC as external
  encoders. It does not link against them.
